{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing ResNet50 with ImageNet ViT-L as the image encoder in a multimodal multiprofile model using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion. The validation accuracy of 0.7062 suggests the stronger image encoder may improve performance compared to ResNet50, but the role of multiprofile settings and other factors remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative configurations."
}

